---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Friends System – Save, Reconnect & Chat History | Airwalk Blog" description="Never lose a great connection again. Airwalk's friends system lets you save matches, view chat history, and reconnect anytime.">
  <header class="fixed top-0 w-full z-50 bg-gray-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Airwalk</a>
      <a href="/chat" class="bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition">Start Chatting</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-12 space-y-6 mt-20">
    <article class="space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">Friends System: Save Connections, Revisit History, Reconnect Anytime</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Published on June 1, 2026</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300">We've all been there — an incredible conversation with a stranger that ends, and they're gone forever. Airwalk's friends system ensures that never happens again. Save the people who matter and reconnect whenever you want.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">How the Friends System Works</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">At any point during or after a conversation, you can send a friend request. If both people accept, you're connected. Your friend appears in your contacts list with their anonymous alias, and you can message them anytime — no more relying on luck to find them again.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Chat History You Control</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">With friends, your conversation history is preserved. Scroll back to remember that joke they told, the song they recommended, or the deep topic you discussed at 3AM. Your history is private, encrypted, and only visible to both of you. Either person can delete it at any time.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Reconnect Without the Awkwardness</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Sometimes life gets busy and you drift apart from an online friend. Airwalk makes reconnecting easy with a simple "Hey, it's been a while" prompt. No guilt, no pressure — just a gentle nudge to pick up where you left off. Because good connections deserve a second chance.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Privacy First, Always</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Adding someone as a friend doesn't reveal your real identity. You remain anonymous unless you choose to share personal details. Unfriend or block anyone instantly with zero consequences. You're always in control of who stays in your circle.</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300">Great conversations shouldn't be one-time events. Save the ones that matter.</p>
    </article>

    <div class="text-center py-8 border-t border-gray-800">
      <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">Ready to build meaningful connections?</p>
      <a href="/chat" class="inline-block bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-medium transition">Start Chatting & Making Friends</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-gray-800 py-8 text-center text-gray-500 text-sm">
    <p>&copy; 2026 Airwalk. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</Layout>
